{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nI am sitting in Koblenz at the window, which overlooks the Rhine and the Ehrenbreitstein Castle, and eating grapes, which are so sweet here that one could easily forget that one is far from home. Early in the morning I was at the post office, hopeful for a sign from you, but the drawer was empty. It is Immanuel's birthday, and I have resolved to drink an extra glass to his health at noon. It is a loss not to have him here to toast him personally, but his name tastes particularly good in the wine today.\n\nThe landscape is grand, but the silence is oppressive. I think of Karl and of you both. Please write to me soon, whether you are well. I will undertake the journey to Holland as soon as the post is secure.\n\nYour faithful Wilhelm"}}],"created":1795221081,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":174,"prompt_tokens":260,"total_tokens":434,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-HLOV5DqELEU4MS0g0asNoB5Z4Da9Km4c","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":260,"prompt_ms":502.599,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.9330730769230768,"prompt_per_second":517.3110173319087,"predicted_n":174,"predicted_ms":4051.281,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.417809248554914,"predicted_per_second":42.70254272660919}}